      "name": "dsh-inbox-bridge",
      "title": {
        "en": "GitHub inbox",
        "zh": "GitHub 收件箱"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turns GitHub CI runs, pull requests and issues into one notice queued at the start of the next turn: it queues by default and does not open a turn, and wakeup mode wakes one idle session. Items move through pending / delivered / done so the same event is not repeated forever.",
        "zh": "把 GitHub 的 CI、PR 和 issue 变成下一次对话开头的一条通知：默认只排队，不替你开轮；wakeup 模式会唤醒一个空闲会话。条目分 pending / delivered / done 三态，同一事件不会无限重复。"
      },
